{"seq":1,"at":"2026-09-17","kind":"imported","target":{"type":"article","id":"a0965"},"reason":"Article of the Quiztopia bank (written for card c081): researched and transcribed in September 2026, converted to the quiz platform on 2026-10-20.","by":"Quiztopia import","ref":"quiz-archive/transcripts/quiztopia/c081.json"},
{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a0965"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge sport-games/olympics","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/sport-games__olympics.g3.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",392],["+","Comparing the two lists shows what the women's programme leaves out: of the decathlon's three throws it keeps the shot put and the javelin but drops the discus throw, and the pole vault and the 400 metres are missing as well. The heptathlon replaced the five-event women's pentathlon in 1981. "],["=",495]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",366],["+","Vergleich der beiden Listen zeigt, was im Programm der Frauen fehlt: Von den drei Würfen des Zehnkampfs bleiben Kugelstoßen und Speerwurf, der Diskuswurf dagegen entfällt, ebenso Stabhochsprung und 400-Meter-Lauf. Der Siebenkampf löste 1981 den Fünfkampf der Frauen ab. Der "],["=",457]]}]},
