{"seq":6,"at":"2026-10-21","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a0965"},"reason":"Proofread (reasons in the entries above / the batch report).","by":"enrich batch 211","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-enrich/enrich-report/a0605-a1073.md","changes":[{"field":"notesEn","old":"","new":"The decathlon question accepts any five of its ten events, the heptathlon question any three of its seven; the stored answers are the opening events of each first day."},{"field":"notesDe","old":"","new":"Bei der Zehnkampf-Frage zählen beliebige fünf der zehn Disziplinen, bei der Siebenkampf-Frage beliebige drei der sieben; gespeichert sind jeweils die ersten Disziplinen des ersten Tages."}],"hash":"658f4d1060d3"},
